     "<p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">We’re excited to announce that the <strong>2027 Immcantation Users Group Meeting</strong> will take place on <strong>January 21st, 2027</strong> — and we hope you&#39;ll join us! </p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">This annual event brings together researchers, developers, and users to share insights, learn about recent developments, and connect around all things Immcantation and Adaptive Immune Receptor Repertoire (AIRR) analysis. </p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">📅 Date: January 21st, 2027 (from 10:00am to 1:30pm ET) <br>📍 Location: Virtual (Zoom) <br>🗓️ Registration and abstract submission opens: September 1st, 2026</p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">Stay tuned! Visit <a href=\"https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimmcantation.github.io%2Fusers-meeting%2F2027&amp;data=05%...%40yale.edu%7Cc9353b969d6e4838306108defed42119%7Cdd8cbebb21394df8b4114e3e87abeb5c%7C0%7C0%7C639228384209865674%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=K%2BAYYiAt5AeGrCwGvs2PIcd8tqrmogDxMgWHW0pbwao%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\" title=\"Original URL: https://immcantation.github.io/users-meeting/2027. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" style=\"border:0px;font:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimmcantation.github.io%252Fusers-meeting%252F2027%26data%3D05%257C02%257Csusanna.marquez%2540yale.edu%257Cc9353b969d6e4838306108defed42119%257Cdd8cbebb21394df8b4114e3e87abeb5c%257C0%257C0%257C639228384209865674%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DK%252BAYYiAt5AeGrCwGvs2PIcd8tqrmogDxMgWHW0pbwao%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499450720000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qKic66O73aogUZ18K35D6\">https://immcantation.github.io/users-meeting/2027</a> for updated information, including registration, agenda, and abstract submission deadlines. </p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">We look forward to seeing you there! </p><p style=\"color:rgb(36,36,36);font-size:15px\">Warm regards, <br>The Immcantation Team <br><a href=\"https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimmcantation.org%2F&amp;data=05%...%40yale.edu%7Cc9353b969d6e4838306108defed42119%7Cdd8cbebb21394df8b4114e3e87abeb5c%7C0%7C0%7C639228384209891353%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=BUEZh8%2FHTLPxmPMmX19U0iLe1gPaIf2nVmXmf4z7PV0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\" title=\"Original URL: https://immcantation.org/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" style=\"border:0px;font:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimmcantation.org%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Csusanna.marquez%2540yale.edu%257Cc9353b969d6e4838306108defed42119%257Cdd8cbebb21394df8b4114e3e87abeb5c%257C0%257C0%257C639228384209891353%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DBUEZh8%252FHTLPxmPMmX19U0iLe1gPaIf2nVmXmf4z7PV0%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792499450720000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37FdAjE3GvFOdnm0mEFIhP\">https://immcantation.org</a> </p>"
